wayparam (0.8.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Add Temporal Surface Intelligence with deterministic yearly/monthly
    archive timelines for normalized URL and parameter activity.
  * Add archive period comparisons with added, removed and persisted
    classifications for normalized URL shapes and parameter names.
  * Expose temporal timelines and period comparisons in the local web UI.
  * Keep all temporal classifications explicitly scoped to archive-index
    evidence rather than live-target state.

