wayparam (0.7.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Add opt-in per-source provenance for normalized archive URL evidence.
  * Add provider-neutral source overlap summaries with union, shared,
    all-source overlap and source-exclusive counts.
  * Apply bounded source-summary budgets independently to each selected
    provider so later archive sources are not starved.
  * Expose provenance and source overlap summaries in the local web UI.

